<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed sharply lower in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 49.94 to 5606.96.</p>
<p>The NYSE composite fell 2.73 to 349.64.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.30.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 1587 to 749.</p>
<p>Volume was 360,544,230, compared with 351,262,000 Wednesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EDT/2045 GMT)</p>
</text>
